{
  "_comment": "Functional QA on a real app: microblog (MIT) @ a975ef6 (Flask, Flask-WTF/CSRF), run locally. Selector keys from `main.py map --explore-actions`; pages not linked from the map (another user's profile, register) are named live (exact names). Credentials: QAX_VAR_MB_USER / QAX_VAR_MB_PASSWORD.",
